WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.450
Care helps you keep in touch with your class.

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:08.870
Open Care, then choose Mine to see your assigned check-ins.

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:13.290
Use Not called this week to find children still needing a call.

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:17.710
After making a call, select Log call beside the child’s name.

00:00:18.030 --> 00:00:22.130
Check the date, choose the outcome, and add a brief, appropriate note.

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:26.550
Choose Save call. You can see the saved entry in the call history.

00:00:26.870 --> 00:00:30.970
For a visit, choose Log call or visit from your follow-up list.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:36.801
Under New visitation entry, check the status and date, add a note, and choose Save entry.

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:43.922
Back in Care, review your follow-up list. Keep notes relevant and avoid unnecessary personal details.
